      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Undoably delete the previous Generate click's repaired result(s) before running this one, so at most one repaired result per source mesh accumulates in the scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
